#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>パーラカの里のアルカソーダラ族の青年は、友人のことが心配のようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Der junge Arkasodara macht sich Sorgen um einen Freund.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Ce jeune Arkasodara semble s'inquiéter pour l'un de ses amis.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>The young Arkasodara is staring off into the jungle with worry in his eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの「Say」モードで『スシェーナ』と入力し<br><sheet EObj 2012260 0>で友人に呼びかける
#. de: Am Zielort im „Sagen“-Chatmodus „Sushena“ eingeben
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, appeler Sushena, à l'endroit indiqué
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_TODO_00:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, enter any phrase containing “Sushena” to call out for him."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 声のする方でスシェーナを探す
#. de: Sushena suchen
#. fr: Retrouver Sushena
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Investigate the sounds."
msgstr ""

#. ja: スシェーナに<sheet EventItem 2003384 0>を使う
#. de: Sushena mit <noun-de EventItem 5 2003384 1 3 1> behandeln
#. fr: Soigner Sushena grâce à la <noun-fr EventItem 12 2003384 1 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Use the healing salve on Sushena."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アルカソーダラ族の青年に報告
#. de: Mit dem jungen Arkasodara sprechen
#. fr: Retourner voir le jeune Arkasodara
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_TODO_03:1"
msgid "Report to the Arkasodara youth."
msgstr ""

#. ja: す、すみません……あなた旅の方ですよね？<br>よければ、里の者には内密に依頼を受けていただけませんか？<br>私の友人の安否を確認してきてほしいのです。
#. de: Verzeih, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>, kannst du mir helfen, meinen Freund zu finden? Aber bitte erzähl niemandem im Dorf davon, ja?
#. fr: Excusez-moi, voyageu<if $gn4>se<else>r</if><nbsp>! Est-ce que vous auriez le temps d'accepter une mission super secrète<nbsp>? J'ai besoin qu'une personne s'assure que mon ami est en sécurité...
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_000:1"
msgid "Ah, excuse me, but you're a traveler, yes? Would you be willing to take on a personal request? I'm worried for the safety of a friend of mine, and would ask you to check on them."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ありがとうございます。<br>私の友人は、ちょっとばかり個性的でして、<br>この災厄を無事に乗り越えられているのか不安で……。
#. de: Danke! Mein Freund ist etwas ungewöhnlich und lebt allein im Wald. Ich habe ihn schon lange nicht mehr gesehen und mache mir Sorgen, ob er die Katastrophe überlebt hat.
#. fr: Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Il est un peu... unique et je m'inquiète de savoir s'il a survécu à cette tragédie.
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_001:1"
msgid "Thank you. I know you have no shortage of demands on your time. My friend, you see, he's a bit of a private person, and I only wish to know how he is faring after the recent troubles."
msgstr ""

#. ja: かといって、里の者には頼めないし、<br>いまの状況で私が行くのは、危険すぎるし……。<br>なので、とても強そうな旅人さんにお願いしたいのです。
#. de: Die Leute im Dorf kann ich nicht bitten und für mich allein wäre die Suche zu gefährlich. Du siehst stark aus und reist viel herum. Du findest ihn bestimmt!
#. fr: Je ne peux vraiment pas demander cette faveur à un des villageois, et c'est bien trop dangereux pour moi... Vous êtes mon seul espoir<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_002:1"
msgid "However, the journey to his abode is much too dangerous for me to attempt alone, and I wouldn't dare ask another villager to go in my stead. A traveler with a sharp blade, however, could surely get the task done with little effort."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 友人は、きっといつもの場所……森の北西側にいると思います。<br>地図に印を付けておきますので、<br>そのあたりで「スシェーナ」と呼びかけてください。
#. de: Wir haben uns oft im Wald nordwestlich von hier getroffen. Ich markiere die Stelle auf deiner Karte. Wenn du ihn dort rufst, hört er dich vielleicht. Sein Name ist Sushena.
#. fr: Je pense qu'il est à notre cachette habituelle... au nord-ouest de la forêt. Je vous l'indique sur votre carte, vous n'aurez qu'à crier son nom une fois que vous y serez<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_003:1"
msgid "He resides in the jungle to the northwest, or at least, he used to. I'll mark the location on your map─his name is Sushena, and if you <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>say</ui-edge-color></ui-color> his name, he <i>should</i> respond."
msgstr ""

#. ja: もし怪我などしているようでしたら、<br>この「<sheet EventItem 2003384 0>」を使ってあげてください。<br>報酬はしっかりお渡ししますので、よろしくお願いします！
#. de: Für den Fall, dass er verletzt ist, gebe ich dir <noun-de EventItem 1 2003384 1 4 1> mit. Damit kannst du ihn behandeln. Bitte, bitte, du musst ihn finden!
#. fr: Il est peut-être blessé, alors prenez <noun-fr EventItem 6 2003384 1 1> avec vous, on ne sait jamais. Ah, et j'ai de quoi vous payer pour votre travail, ne vous en faites pas<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_004:1"
msgid "If my worst fears have come to pass and he is wounded, please use this medicine to treat his wounds. You will be rewarded for your efforts, but I suspect you would have helped me even if I had nothing to give in return."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 地図に印を付けておきますので、<br>そのあたりで「スシェーナ」と呼びかけてください。<br>きっとなにか、反応があるはずです。
#. de: Bitte rufe im Wald nordwestlich von hier nach meinem Freund Sushena. Falls er dort ist, wird er dir bestimmt antworten.
#. fr: Je marque l'endroit sur votre carte, vous n'aurez qu'à crier son nom une fois que vous y serez, je suis sûr qu'il vous répondra<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_005:1"
msgid "I've marked the location that Sushena dwells on your map. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color> his name, and hopefully he will respond in turn."
msgstr ""

#. ja: スシェーナ
#. de: Sushena
#. fr: Sushena
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SYSTEM_000_010:1"
msgid "Sushena"
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで、<br>『スシェーナ』を含む好きな言葉を入力しましょう。
#. de: Gib im Chat-Modus „Sagen“ entweder über die Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur „Sushena“ ein, um nach ihm zu rufen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour appeler Sushena en prononçant son nom.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SYSTEM_000_011:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter any phrase containing the word “Sushena” near the area marked on your map."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 南西の方角から、弱々しい何かの鳴き声が聞こえた……。<br>声のする方へ行ってみよう。
#. de: Du hörst eine schwächliche Stimme aus südwestlicher Richtung. Suche dort nach Sushena.
#. fr: Vous entendez une faible voix provenant de l'ouest... Dirigez-vous vers sa source.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SYSTEM_000_012:1"
msgid "You hear faint sounds of an animal in pain emanating from the direction of the bluffs. Investigate its source."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやら怪我をしているようだ。<br>「スシェーナ」に、「<sheet EventItem 2003384 0>」を使おう。
#. de: Sushena scheint verletzt zu sein. Behandle ihn mit <noun-de EventItem 5 2003384 1 3 1>.
#. fr: Sushena semble blessé. Utilisez <noun-fr EventItem 2 2003384 1 1> pour le soulager.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SYSTEM_000_020:1"
msgid "The yeti appears to be wounded. Perhaps the medicine provided to you will alleviate its suffering."
msgstr ""

#. ja: グガ……グガ……。
#. de: Rooah<nbsp>...
#. fr: Groonnn, gron...
#. speaker: FRIEND04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_FRIEND04262_000_030:1"
msgid "\\<huff> \\<pant>...Ugwah...\\<pant>...Ungeh..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやらお礼を言っているようだ。<br>これでもう大丈夫だろう。<br>「アルカソーダラ族の青年」に報告しよう。
#. de: Es scheint ihm wieder besser zu gehen. Kehre zum jungen Arkasodara zurück.
#. fr: Il semblerait qu'il tente de vous remercier. Sushena devrait se remettre bien vite grâce à vos soins, vous pouvez retourner rassurer le jeune Arkasodara.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_SYSTEM_000_031:1"
msgid "Although you cannot understand the yeti's words, you can sense the gratitude behind them. Return to the young Arkasodara and inform him that his friend is well."
msgstr ""

#. ja: おかえりなさい、旅人さん！<br>友人の様子はどうでしたか？
#. de: Sag schon, hast du meinen Freund gefunden?
#. fr: Alors<nbsp>? Vous l'avez retrouvé<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_040:1"
msgid "Welcome back, traveler! So, how was he?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ああ……やはり怪我を……。<br>スシェーナは、森の中でピシャーチャに襲われていた私を、<br>勇敢にも助けてくれた大切な友人なんです。
#. de: Sushena ist ein guter Freund! Er hat mich gerettet, als ich im Wald von einem Pisaca überfallen wurde.
#. fr: Oh non, le pauvre...<nbsp>! Sushena est venu à mon secours il y a longtemps, alors que je me faisais attaquer par un pishacha dans la forêt. Depuis ce jour-là, c'est devenu un ami cher...
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_041:1"
msgid "Oh, that's horrible! Still, I suppose I can be grateful that you could treat his wounds. I owe Sushena my life─when I was attacked by one of those terrible pisaca, Sushena's roar drove the monster off."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それ以来、密かに私はスシェーナと友情を育んできました。<br>しかし、家族は危険だからと、私が森に入ることを禁じている。<br>いったいどうすれば……！？
#. de: Seitdem haben wir viel Zeit zusammen im Wald verbracht. Jetzt hat mir meine Familie verboten, in den Wald zu gehen, weil es dort zu gefährlich ist. Was soll ich jetzt machen?
#. fr: Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, ma famille m'interdit d'aller dans la forêt sous prétexte que c'est trop dangereux... Je ne sais pas quoi faire<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_100_041:1"
msgid "That was the start of our friendship─one I've treasured ever since. But my family has forbidden me from venturing into the woods, so I haven't been able to check up on him. I know they're only worried for my safety, but still..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何と言う？
#. de: Was sagst du?
#. fr: Que répondez-vous<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you say?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 正直に家族に相談するべきだ
#. de: Du solltest offen mit deiner Familie darüber sprechen.
#. fr: Tu devrais en parler avec eux.
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "You should explain everything to them."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 友人を見捨てるのか？
#. de: Du kannst deinen Freund doch nicht allein lassen.
#. fr: Tu vas abandonner ton ami à son sort, alors<nbsp>?
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "You shouldn't abandon your friend!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……はっ！<br>おっしゃるとおりです。<br>家族に真実を打ち明けて、手を貸してもらいます！
#. de: Du hast Recht. Ich werde meinen Eltern die Wahrheit sagen und sie um Hilfe bitten.
#. fr: ... Vous avez raison<nbsp>!!! Je vais tout leur raconter et demander leur soutien<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_042:1"
msgid "You're right, of course. Surely if I explain Sushena's bravery and selflessness, they'd understand. I've nothing to lose by trying, anyways!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 旅人さんは私と友人の恩人ですよ。<br>少ないですけど、報酬をどうぞ。<br>ありがとうございました！
#. de: Tausend Dank, <if $gn4>Reisende<else>Reisender</if>! Du hast unsere Freund<shy>schaft gerettet!
#. fr: Je vous remercie pour votre aide, en tout cas<nbsp>! Tenez, voici pour vous.
#. speaker: YOUTH04262
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzf007_04262:TEXT_AKTKZF007_04262_YOUTH04262_000_043:1"
msgid "Thank you. Not only did you save Sushena, but you've reminded me what true friendship is worth. It's not much, but please, take this!"
msgstr ""
